Please create a simple local JSON file-system database system to save our graded cards so they show up on the dashboard. 

We need to:
1. Create a `data/database.json` file to store card objects.
2. Build a new backend file `services/storage_engine.js` with functions to save a card and retrieve all cards.
3. Update our `/api/grade` route to save the results to this database.
4. Create a new `GET /api/cards` route so the frontend can load the saved card list.
